OL,3,GNEWSAKiller driver mowed down man and
OL,4,Areversed over him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who knocked a man down and
OL,7,Freversed over him twice before fleeing
OL,8,Fthe scene in Birmingham has been
OL,9,Fconvicted of murder.
OL,11,FMomodou Johm, of Lodge Causeway,
OL,12,FBristol, was found guilty at Birmingham
OL,13,FCrown Court on Friday.
OL,15,FHis victim, Adis Chala, 27, had been
OL,16,Fout with friends when a white BMW
OL,17,Fclipped his leg as he walked along Mott
OL,18,FStreet in the city centre, in the early
OL,19,Fhours of 20 April.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
