OL,3,GNEWSAKiller driver mowed down man and
OL,4,Areversed over him
OL,5,
OL,6,FChala followed the car a short distance
OL,7,Fand banged his hands on the driver's
OL,8,Fside door before Johm reversed the car
OL,9,Fand knocked him to the ground. Johm
OL,10,Fdrove forward again before reversing
OL,11,Fover Chala for a second time and
OL,12,Fdriving off.
